@startuml 3.8.5 - Preview Post
title Sequence Diagram — 3.8.5 - Preview Post

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
actor "Creator / Manager" as creatormanager
boundary "PostController" as postcontroller
boundary "PostEditorPage (Preview Panel)" as posteditorpageprevie
entity "PostPreviewResponse" as postpreviewresponse
entity "PostMongoRepository" as postmongorepository
control "PostServiceImpl" as postserviceimpl

' === Flow ===
creatormanager -> posteditorpageprevie: Select platform tab (e.g., THREADS / INSTAGRAM / TIKTOK / FB)
posteditorpageprevie -> postcontroller: GET /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/posts/{postId}/preview?platform=?
postcontroller -> postserviceimpl: generatePlatformPreview(workspaceId, postId, platform)
postserviceimpl -> postmongorepository: findByIdAndWorkspaceId(postId, workspaceId)
postmongorepository --> postserviceimpl: return PostDocument (contentText, media, hashtags)
postserviceimpl -> postserviceimpl: validateAndTransformLayout(postDoc, platform)
postserviceimpl -> postpreviewresponse: new PostPreviewResponse(formattedText, mediaUrls, platformLayoutRules, warnings)
postpreviewresponse --> postserviceimpl: return previewResponse
postserviceimpl --> postcontroller: return previewResponse
postcontroller --> posteditorpageprevie: return 200 OK (ApiResponse { data: previewResponse })
posteditorpageprevie --> creatormanager: Render mockup layout

@enduml
